WEBVTT

00:04:29.849 --> 00:04:34.103
Yana bir variant -
tortishish kuchi zaifroq joyda qurish .

00:04:34.103 --> 00:04:36.897
Mars yoki Oyga asoslangan kosmik liftlar

00:04:36.897 --> 00:04:39.650
mavjud materiallar bilan
allaqachon mumkin .

00:04:39.775 --> 00:04:44.905
Ammo Yerga asoslangan kosmik liftga
ega bo’lishning katta iqtisodiy afzalligi

00:04:44.905 --> 00:04:49.035
ko’plab mamlakatlarni bu jumboqni
yengib chiqishga ilhomlantirdi .

00:04:49.035 --> 00:04:52.621
Aslida,Xitoy va Yaponiyadagi
ba’zi kompaniyalar

00:04:52.621 --> 00:04:57.168
2050 yilgacha qurilishni  
yakunlashni rejalashtirmoqda .